# STATUS

We apply for the following ACM badges:

## Artifacts Available
The artifact is permanently archived on Zenodo with DOI
10.5281/zenodo.19339901, publicly accessible without registration,
and released under the MIT license.

## Artifacts Reusable
Beyond reproducing the paper's results, the artifact is structured
for reuse:
- The plan compliance metrics (PPC, POC, PPF, PC) are implemented
  as a standalone installable Python package applicable to any
  SWE-agent trajectory, not just our dataset.
- All 16,991 raw trajectories are shipped in documented JSON format,
  enabling new analyses beyond plan compliance.
- The eight plan-setting configs (plan-settings/) can be dropped
  into SWE-agent to run new experiments with other models.
- A Docker image, smoke test, per-figure reproduction commands, and
  pinned dependencies ensure long-term executability.
